WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.000
[calm electronic music]

2
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.600
[keys typing]

3
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.333
Every coding agent has a usage limit.

4
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.400
And it always hits at the worst moment.

5
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.567
Thousands of developers feel the need for it.

6
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:19.567
Mid-task, your agent stops. The limit resets at three a.m., and nobody's there to say continue.

7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[clock ticking]

8
00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.233
[music rises]

9
00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.267
Meet Agent Rewake.

10
00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:26.452
It schedules your resume prompt automatically, for the moment the limit resets.

11
00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.633
[chime]

12
00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:27.867
[whoosh]

13
00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.667
[clock ticking]

14
00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:30.833
[chime]

15
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:34.900
At three oh one, it sends your message. Same session, same context, same thread.

16
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.567
Then the next message, and the next.

17
00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:40.233
Fully configurable, even the resume prompt.

18
00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:45.400
Send later. Repeat on a schedule. Even cron, read back in plain words.

19
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.786
Every thread, on one page.

20
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.567
Rewake works with the coding agents you already use.

21
00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:54.310
One plugin for all of them.

22
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.933
[keys typing]

23
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.429
One command finds your agents, shows every change, and asks first.

24
00:00:58.333 --> 00:00:58.933
[keys typing]

25
00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.167
[chime]

26
00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:02.500
No more babysitting for your AI agents.

27
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.671
Agent Rewake. Free and open source, for your coding agents.

28
00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:07.800
[music resolves and fades out]
